<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela delays Debt Rescue Fund Bill proposal.</title>
<headline>Venezuela delays Debt Rescue Fund Bill proposal.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's Congress delayed approval of the country's long-awaited Debt Rescue Fund on Thursday for lack of a quorum, legislators said.</p>
<p>Legislators said approval of the Fund, which will be used to buy back domestic and foreign debt including Bradies, was now unlikely before Congress closed for the summer holidays on July 6.</p>
<p>((-- Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
